沿，另一副还朝着对面的坐处。仆妇端饭进来，把菜放下，看了看空凳，问可要等一等。湘云道：“饭都盛来了，又等什么？”仆妇听她声气急，便不再问，伸手要撤那一副箸，她却自己拿住了，说放着罢。仆妇手停了停，转去取汤。湘云望着手中的箸，将两根并在一起，横放在桌角，仍没有放回箸笼。\n \n 菜是家常的，饭也煮得足。湘云夹了一口，说今日味淡，仆妇答道昨日还嫌咸，故少下了些盐。这话本说得平常，湘云却道：“我昨日说那一碟咸，又没说凡是锅里的都别放盐。”仆妇端着汤，脸上顿时没了话，只问要不要另回锅。湘云见汤碗沿贴着她的指头，叫她先搁下，自己又吃了一口。仆妇拿着炒菜的匙等，她抬起头道：“不必炒了，端点盐来。我才说急了，你还要忙别的，别只立在这里。”仆妇道：“我忙倒不怕，怕做了又不合口。”湘云有些讪讪的，拨开饭上的热气，说添盐她自己来便是。\n ","editorial_notes":{"path":"artifacts/agent_research/v5-revision-20261027/revisions/ch97-editorial-notes.json","sha256":"cbb06250a6eae4cb2774ed310893007dc57732f3e286e6f2d06161799962f0d6"},"import":{"authority_effect":"NONE","candidate":{"path":"artifacts/candidates/ch97/b26bd71415e87fe1479b2e78fd34ae2da6e80f7f4514816644533faf94987bd3.txt","sha256":"b26bd71415e87fe1479b2e78fd34ae2da6e80f7f4514816644533faf94987bd3"},"draft":{"path":"data/writing/drafts/ch97/d99ce6f19327a0258b6d713e7db3f3d8dba9720fb172c5fc99b5288fd3c122fb.json","sha256":"d99ce6f19327a0258b6d713e7db3f3d8dba9720fb172c5fc99b5288fd3c122fb"},"execution_basis":"SESSION_AUTHORED_NOT_PROVIDER_VERIFIED","formal_eligibility":false,"human_qualification":false,"input_snapshot":{"path":"artifacts/writing-inputs/manifests/bb80f9f3d215197ffb576c8d252f6c4517cce1db28f28ea3c6010f291b957bd9.json","sha256":"bb80f9f3d215197ffb576c8d252f6c4517cce1db28f28ea3c6010f291b957bd9"},"prepared_request":{"path":"artifacts/writing-requests/7673faf690855a5cca1a46d6c4f3e40164e278bb03e74b50730b52d609238bc2.json","sha256":"7673faf690855a5cca1a46d6c4f3e40164e278bb03e74b50730b52d609238bc2"},"qualification":"RESEARCH_ONLY","run":{"path":"artifacts/author-runs/8318a668382be9be3cd2b3b349558ad7987cdf11f4dfd26ab5097386bb737d98.json","sha256":"8318a668382be9be3cd2b3b349558ad7987cdf11f4dfd26ab5097386bb737d98"},"session_configured_model":{"basis":"UNVERIFIED_DECLARATION","label":"current agent environment; root actual v5 editor"},"status":"PASS"},"peer_review":"PENDING_NEW_INPUT_CI_AND_NEW_READERS","previous":{"candidate":{"path":"artifacts/candidates/ch97/30197aedf723c5d9454e1c2bb6c59857